{
  "abstract": "Yilin Liu's mathematical proof and Lean formalization establish an upper bound of n choose 2 for every n in rank three, an asymptotic forcing threshold of n choose (r - 1) at each fixed rank r at least three (Erdős #643(ii)), and the eventual exact avoiding maximum (n - 1) choose (r - 1) plus floor((n - 1)/r) at each fixed rank r at least four. This repository contains the substantive Lean development ported from Liu's September 2026 submission.",
